    "type": 0,
    "content": "I’m releasing the second guide of IdleOn Academy: the “Fixing Guide”.\n⚠️ This guide is still a work in progress, but I’m sharing it early for players who want to dive in already.\n\nThis guide focuses on the “Fixing Phase” — the stage where you backtrack and optimize your account to clean up mistakes and unlock stronger progression.\n\n👉 Current content:\n\nAlchemy explained from A to Z\n\nHow Alchemy fits into long-term account strength\n\nEven in its unfinished state, the Alchemy section alone can already significantly improve your account if you’ve been neglecting or misusing it.\n\nThis guide will continue to expand with:\n\nBreeding\n\nRift / Cards Farming\n\nCrystal Farming\n\nDivinity / Lab\n\nIf you like understanding why things work instead of just copying steps, this guide is for you.\n\n🔗 Fixing Guide (WIP):\n👉  https://my.visme.co/view/y71djywx-idleon-academy-the-fixing\n\nFeedback is welcome, this guide is actively evolving. 🚀",
